WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.833
(Mozart's Requiem: Lacrimosa)

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:14.114
- [Voiceover] I saw my Dad
cheating over Facebook.

00:00:14.114 --> 00:00:16.338
I don't have the guts to tell
my Mom because I don't want

00:00:16.338 --> 00:00:19.434
me and my siblings to end
up having a broken family.

00:00:19.434 --> 00:00:21.363
- [Voiceover] I caught my Mom
cheating on my Dad, so I keyed

00:00:21.363 --> 00:00:23.210
her car and flattened her tires.

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:25.418
I'm not sure how our relationship
will piece back together

00:00:25.418 --> 00:00:26.579
after that.

00:00:26.579 --> 00:00:28.219
- [Voiceover] I found out my
Dad was cheating on my Mom

00:00:28.219 --> 00:00:29.434
and told her about it.

00:00:29.434 --> 00:00:31.539
Now they're getting a divorce
and I know it's not my fault

00:00:31.539 --> 00:00:32.891
but I feel like it is.

00:00:32.891 --> 00:00:34.636
- [Voiceover] I found my
Mom cheating on my Dad with

00:00:34.636 --> 00:00:36.859
one of his friends five years ago.

00:00:36.859 --> 00:00:38.835
My Dad still doesn't know
and it kills me every day

00:00:38.835 --> 00:00:40.125
for not telling him.

00:00:40.125 --> 00:00:41.804
- [Voiceover] When I was
little I caught my Dad cheating

00:00:41.804 --> 00:00:43.141
on my Mom.

00:00:43.141 --> 00:00:45.067
I never told anyone because
I thought I could convince

00:00:45.067 --> 00:00:47.382
myself it was just a nightmare I had.

00:00:47.382 --> 00:00:49.029
- [Voiceover] I caught my
Dad cheating on my Mom.

00:00:49.029 --> 00:00:52.923
He paid me $250 to keep my
mouth shut but I told her anyway

00:00:52.923 --> 00:00:54.129
and kept the money.

00:00:54.129 --> 00:00:56.517
- [Voiceover] I caught my Mom
cheating on my Dad and she has

00:00:56.517 --> 00:00:58.555
no idea why I'm shutting down.

00:00:58.555 --> 00:01:00.290
- [Voiceover] I caught my
Dad cheating with my aunt

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:02.066
when I was 17.

00:01:02.066 --> 00:01:04.819
Now I'm 22 with no relationship whatsoever

00:01:04.819 --> 00:01:07.851
and a fear of a meeting a guy like him.

00:01:07.851 --> 00:01:10.853
I feel like I'm too broken
to love and to be loved.

00:01:10.853 --> 00:01:13.044
- [Voicemail] I saw my Dad
cheating and he put his condom

00:01:13.044 --> 00:01:15.740
in my room and told my
Mom it was me having sex.

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:16.573
I was 12.

